notes = "(!) mcpx_1.0.bin (MD5 d49c52a4102f6df7bcf8d0617ac475ed), the flash BIOS and the hard disk image go into system/xemu/; other names can be set in the core options.|(!) A ready-made hard disk image is on github.com/xemu-project/xemu-hdd-image.|(!) Renders with RetroArch's glcore or vulkan video driver; on macOS use glcore, on Android vulkan.|Game saves live inside xbox_hdd.qcow2, not in the frontend save directory.|Save states are not supported."
description = "A port of xemu, the original Xbox emulator, to libretro. It needs the console's MCPX boot ROM and flash BIOS, dumped from your own Xbox, and a hard disk image, in system/xemu/."
